OL,6,     FTeleshopping with High Street TV  
OL,7,G0855 Four in a Bed                     
OL,8,     FThe competition starts at One 4   
OL,9,     FB&B in Cheltenham, where debonair 
OL,10,     Fhost and part-time art dealer Nick
OL,11,     Fproves his naked ambition with a  
OL,12,     Flife drawing class for his guests.
OL,13,G0930 Four in a Bed                     
OL,14,     FGloria and Dave host at the Windy 
OL,15,     FBottom B&B in Maidstone. But      
OL,16,     FNick's not dazzled by the bling in
OL,17,     Fhis Versace-themed boudoir and    
OL,18,     Fthere are dirty tricks on a trip  
OL,19,     Fto a maze.                        
